  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><span class=\"noexcerpt\"><div class=\"noexcerpt\" style=\"margin-top:0.2em; margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><div style=\"margin-left:1.6em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_icon.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Disambig icon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/19px-Disambig_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/29px-Disambig_icon.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/38px-Disambig_icon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"225\" data-file-height=\"190\" /></a> <i>This article is about an outpost. This name is also used for a <a href=\"/wiki/Jennur%27s_Horde\" title=\"Jennur&#39;s Horde\">mission</a>&#32;and&#32;a <a href=\"/wiki/Jennur%27s_Horde_(Zaishen_quest)\" title=\"Jennur&#39;s Horde (Zaishen quest)\">Zaishen mission quest</a>.</i></div></div></span>\n<table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\" class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Jennur's Horde\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Jennur%27s_Horde.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Jennur&#39;s Horde.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/d/d8/Jennur%27s_Horde.jpg/196px-Jennur%27s_Horde.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"196\" srcset=\"/images/d/d8/Jennur%27s_Horde.jpg 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Region\" title=\"Region\">Region</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Vabbi\" title=\"Vabbi\">Vabbi</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mission_outpost\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mission outpost\">Mission outpost</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">Party</a> size\n</th>\n<td>8\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Exit(s)\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Forum_Highlands\" title=\"Forum Highlands\">Forum Highlands</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Vehjin_Mines\" title=\"Vehjin Mines\">Vehjin Mines</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Images\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Jennur%27s_Horde_world_map.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Jennur&#39;s Horde world map.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/9/99/Jennur%27s_Horde_world_map.jpg/196px-Jennur%27s_Horde_world_map.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"148\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/9/99/Jennur%27s_Horde_world_map.jpg/294px-Jennur%27s_Horde_world_map.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/9/99/Jennur%27s_Horde_world_map.jpg/392px-Jennur%27s_Horde_world_map.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"724\" data-file-height=\"545\" /></a><br /><small>On the world map</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Jennur%27s_Horde_inside.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Jennur&#39;s Horde inside.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/f/f5/Jennur%27s_Horde_inside.jpg/196px-Jennur%27s_Horde_inside.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"157\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/f5/Jennur%27s_Horde_inside.jpg/294px-Jennur%27s_Horde_inside.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/f5/Jennur%27s_Horde_inside.jpg/392px-Jennur%27s_Horde_inside.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"800\" /></a><br /><small>A view inside</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<blockquote style=\"font-style: italic; padding: 0em 2em 0em 1em; margin: 1em 0em 1em 4em; border-left: 1px solid #DDD;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; margin-top: -0.2em; margin-left: -0.8em; font: bold 5em Times New Roman, Times, Georgie, serif; color: #EEE;\">“</div>\n<p>A rugged mining camp used by workers in the <a href=\"/wiki/Vehjin_Mines\" title=\"Vehjin Mines\">Vehjin Mines</a>, Jennur's Horde is none the less <small>[<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sic\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Sic\"><span title=\"nonetheless\"><i>sic</i></span></a>]</small> a booming outpost on payday, where miners flush with their spoils go broke again just as quickly in games of chance and impromptu taverns set up in the shadows of abandoned mining equipment.\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 0.9em;\">— in-game description</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Jennur's Horde</a> is the primary semi-permanent settlement for miners working at the <a href=\"/wiki/Vehjin_Mines\" title=\"Vehjin Mines\">Vehjin Mines</a> to the northwest.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Getting_there\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Getting there</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Exits\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Exits</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#NPCs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">NPCs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Allies</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Services\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Services</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Henchmen\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Henchmen</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Other_allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other allies</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Getting_there\">Getting there</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Jennur%27s_Horde_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Getting there\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Primary_quest\" title=\"Primary quest\">primary quest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Heart_or_Mind:_Garden_in_Danger\" title=\"Heart or Mind: Garden in Danger\">Heart or Mind: Garden in Danger</a> will conclude in this outpost. That quest, together with <a href=\"/wiki/Heart_or_Mind:_Ronjok_in_Danger\" title=\"Heart or Mind: Ronjok in Danger\">Heart or Mind: Ronjok in Danger</a>, represents a branch in the Nightfall storyline. While both can be completed, completing just one will make the other one optional.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Exits\">Exits</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Jennur%27s_Horde_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Exits\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Forum_Highlands\" title=\"Forum Highlands\">Forum Highlands</a> (southeast)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Vehjin_Mines\" title=\"Vehjin Mines\">Vehjin Mines</a> (west)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"NPCs\">NPCs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Jennur%27s_Horde_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: NPCs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Allies\">Allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Jennur%27s_Horde_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Services\">Services</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Jennur%27s_Horde_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Services\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Itai\" title=\"Itai\">Itai</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Merchant\" title=\"Merchant\">merchant</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 15 <a href=\"/wiki/Xunlai_Agent\" title=\"Xunlai Agent\">Xunlai Agent</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Storage_upgrades\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Storage upgrades\">storage upgrades</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 24 <a href=\"/wiki/Xunlai_Chest\" title=\"Xunlai Chest\">Xunlai Chest</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Storage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Storage\">storage</a>)</li></ul>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Henchmen\">Henchmen</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Jennur%27s_Horde_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Henchmen\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h5>\n<dl><dd><i>(all level 20)</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Devona\" title=\"Devona\">Devona</a> (Fighter)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ranger\"><img alt=\"Ranger\" src=\"/images/d/dc/Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Aidan\" title=\"Aidan\">Aidan</a> (Archer)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Kihm\" title=\"Kihm\">Kihm</a> (Healer)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Mhenlo\" title=\"Mhenlo\">Mhenlo</a> (Healer)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Necromancer\"><img alt=\"Necromancer\" src=\"/images/7/7b/Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Eve\" title=\"Eve\">Eve</a> (Blood)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Mesmer\"><img alt=\"Mesmer\" src=\"/images/f/fb/Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Odurra\" title=\"Odurra\">Odurra</a> (Illusion)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Cynn\" title=\"Cynn\">Cynn</a> (Fire)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Herta\" title=\"Herta\">Herta</a> (Earth)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Paragon\"><img alt=\"Paragon\" src=\"/images/5/55/Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Sogolon\" title=\"Sogolon\">Sogolon</a> (Motivation)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dervish-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Dervish\"><img alt=\"Dervish\" src=\"/images/3/3e/Dervish-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Gehraz\" title=\"Gehraz\">Gehraz</a> (Holy)</li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_allies\">Other allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Jennur%27s_Horde_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Other allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Master_Gardener_Kobahl\" title=\"Master Gardener Kobahl\">Master Gardener Kobahl</a> (mission access)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Sholhij\" title=\"Sholhij\">Sholhij</a> (mission briefing)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Vabbian_Guard_(warrior)\" title=\"Vabbian Guard (warrior)\">Vabbian Guards</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Vabbian_Noble\" title=\"Vabbian Noble\">Vabbian Nobles</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Jennur%27s_Horde_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Notes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/World_map\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"World map\">world map</a> actually marks this location with the icon for an outpost upon initial arrival. It changes into the icon for a mission outpost only upon completion of the quest that precedes the <a href=\"/wiki/Jennur%27s_Horde\" title=\"Jennur&#39;s Horde\">Jennur's Horde mission</a>, which is <a href=\"/wiki/Heart_or_Mind:_Garden_in_Danger\" title=\"Heart or Mind: Garden in Danger\">Heart or Mind: Garden in Danger</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Jennur%27s_Horde_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Trivia\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table style=\"float: right; border: 1px solid #D16E5A; width: 250px; margin: 0 0 1em 1em; line-height: 1.4em; font-size: 0.9em; background: #F9F9F9;\" cellspacing=\"3\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://wiki.guildwars2.com/wiki/Main_Page\" title=\"gw2:Main Page\"><img alt=\"Gw2logo.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/b/b1/Gw2logo.png/41px-Gw2logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b1/Gw2logo.png/61px-Gw2logo.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/b1/Gw2logo.png/81px-Gw2logo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"692\" data-file-height=\"479\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>The <a href=\"https://wiki.guildwars2.com/wiki/Main_Page\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"gw2:Main Page\">Guild Wars 2 Wiki</a>  has an article on <i><b><a href=\"https://wiki.guildwars2.com/wiki/Ruins_of_Jennur%27s_Horde\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"gw2:Ruins of Jennur&#39;s Horde\">Ruins of Jennur's Horde</a></b></i>.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Jennur_Kurah_Hatohn\" title=\"Jennur Kurah Hatohn\">Jennur Kurah Hatohn</a> is an <a href=\"/wiki/NPC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"NPC\">NPC</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mirror_of_Lyss\" title=\"The Mirror of Lyss\">The Mirror of Lyss</a>, but there is no evidence as to whether she is the Jennur referred to in the name.</li></ul>\n<hr style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; clear:both;\" />\n<table style=\"border:1px solid silver; font-size:90%; width:90%; text-align:center; clear:both;\" align=\"center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background:#BAE; font-size:110%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vabbi#Towns_and_outposts\" title=\"Vabbi\">Towns and outposts in Vabbi</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Kodash_Bazaar\" title=\"The Kodash Bazaar\">The Kodash Bazaar</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Basalt_Grotto\" title=\"Basalt Grotto\">Basalt Grotto</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chantry_of_Secrets\" title=\"Chantry of Secrets\">Chantry of Secrets</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dasha_Vestibule_(outpost)\" title=\"Dasha Vestibule (outpost)\">Dasha Vestibule</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dzagonur_Bastion_(outpost)\" title=\"Dzagonur Bastion (outpost)\">Dzagonur Bastion</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh_(outpost)\" title=\"Grand Court of Sebelkeh (outpost)\">Grand Court of Sebelkeh</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Honur_Hill\" title=\"Honur Hill\">Honur Hill</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Jennur's Horde</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mihanu_Township\" title=\"Mihanu Township\">Mihanu Township</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tihark_Orchard_(outpost)\" title=\"Tihark Orchard (outpost)\">Tihark Orchard</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Yahnur_Market\" title=\"Yahnur Market\">Yahnur Market</a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><a href=\"/wiki/Vabbi#Missions\" title=\"Vabbi\">Missions</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Vabbi#Explorable_areas\"